**`design-memory.functions.ts:259-295`** — `insertDesignMemoryItems` loops up to 12 extracted items doing sequential `insert().select().single()` + conditional `upsert()` per item = up to 24 round trips per extraction run (URL import, pasted brand doc, scaffold write-back).
```ts
// before
for (const item of items) {
  const { data: row } = await supabase.from("design_memory").insert({...}).select("id").single();
  if (supersedes) await supabase.from("artifact_lineage").upsert({...});
}
// after — one insert, one upsert
const { data: rows } = await supabase.from("design_memory").insert(items).select("id");
await supabase.from("artifact_lineage").upsert(lineageEdgesFor(rows));
```

**`studio.functions.ts:586-587`** — `listStudioSessions` (loaded every visit to `/build`) awaits two independent `costAndStatusByMission()` calls back-to-back when neither depends on the other.
```ts
const [builder, other] = await Promise.all([
  costAndStatusByMission(runRows),
  costAndStatusByMission(otherRunRows),
]);
```

**`notifications.functions.ts:580-639`** — the digest cron loops sequentially over every due workspace/user. Not user-latency-facing, but chunk it with `Promise.all` so the tick doesn't serialize at scale.

**`feedback.functions.ts:49-51`** — one `bump_memory_importance` RPC call per memory id in a loop; small in practice (1-3 per trace) but should be a batched RPC.

**`OpportunityQueue.tsx:217`** — `rankOpportunities(rows, ...)` runs unmemoized in the render body — the full sort plus per-item `rationaleFor`/`deriveDesignation` reruns on every render (any unrelated hover/open-id state change), even when `rows` hasn't changed.
```ts
const ranked = useMemo(
  () => rankOpportunities(rows, corroborationOf),
  [rows, themeById],
);
```

**`hooks/use-machine-view.tsx:26-37`** — `MachineViewContext.Provider` gets a fresh `{isMachineView, toggle}` object every render. It sits near the app root, so any unrelated root re-render invalidates every consumer.
```ts
const toggle = useCallback(() => setIsMachineView(v => !v), []);
const value = useMemo(() => ({ isMachineView, toggle }), [isMachineView]);
```

Checked and clean: `usePrefersReducedMotion` properly cleans up its listener; `Sketch.tsx`'s `sketchPath` is already `useMemo`'d in both chart components — my earlier concern about those two didn't hold up under closer reading.

**`AccountConnectionsSection.tsx:107-120`** — the GitHub-connect flow starts a `setInterval` polling every 3s, self-clearing only when a 5-minute deadline is reached from inside its own callback. It's never tied to a ref or an unmount cleanup — navigating away mid-poll leaves it running and refetching for up to 5 minutes after the component is gone.
```ts
const ivRef = useRef<ReturnType<typeof setInterval>>();
// in onSuccess:
ivRef.current = setInterval(() => {
  qc.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ["connections"] });
  if (Date.now() > deadline) clearInterval(ivRef.current);
}, 3_000);
// in the component's unmount effect:
useEffect(() => () => clearInterval(ivRef.current), []);
```
A repo-wide listener audit found no other add/remove mismatches.

